"entity": {
"name": "Romande Energie Holding SA",
"description": "Romande Energie Holding SA engages in the generation, marketing, and distribution of energy. It operates through the following business units: Grids, Energy Solutions, Romande Energie Services and Corporate. The Grids business unit operates and manages development of distribution infrastructure for electricity and fibre optics. The Energy Solutions business unit maintains security of supply for customers. The Romande Energie Services offers transitional help in renewable energy through advice and energy audits. The Corporate business unit supports the groups various activities. The company was founded on June 24, 1997 and is headquartered in Morges, Switzerland.",
